    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are people... but they aren't here. they're just voices in my head or people i'll never see. in this moment, it's just me and the fire coming for me. it feels like the world has decided it's done with me. if everything is just going to end in pain and chaos anyway, why is staying alive the only \"right\" thing to do? it feels like a trap.",
